<title>POLAND: Polifarb-W Q1 net rises to PLN 3.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Polifarb-W Q1 net rises to PLN 3.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polifarb Wroclaw SA preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     6.02   vs    4.99</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 6.29   vs    5.47</p>
<p>    net profit			     3.97   vs    3.36</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Polifarb Wroclaw SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     46.01   vs   38.19</p>
<p>    costs of sales			31.27   vs   26.90</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     2.16   vs    2.00</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.16   vs    0.11</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.42   vs    1.14</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.14   vs    0.61</p>
<p>    investment			     4.21   vs    0.67</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
